  "description": "Numeric value primitives for .NET. Provides Fraction<T>, a generic exact-rational number type backed by any IBinaryInteger<T>; Interval<T>, an immutable bounded interval over any INumber<T> with independent open or closed endpoints and full set algebra; BigDecimal, an arbitrary-precision decimal beyond System.Decimal's precision and range; Complex<T>, a generic complex number over any IFloatingPointIeee754<T> (where System.Numerics.Complex is fixed to double); and single-pass statistics aggregates - RunningStatistics<T> (Welford mean/variance), RunningQuantile<T> (P² streaming quantile), and the rolling-window MovingSum<T> / MovingMinMax<T>. Money, currency, and foreign-exchange types ship in the companion Bodu.Financial package.",
